WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.126
Negative feedback keeps body temperature near its set point.

2
00:00:05.027 --> 00:00:09.452
Body temperature stays near thirty seven degrees, its set point.

3
00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:15.237
In very hot air, the body starts to warm.

4
00:00:15.838 --> 00:00:20.113
Sweating and flushed skin bring it back down: negative feedback.

5
00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:23.790
In cold air, shivering warms it back up.
